        <p class="jcdi-label">Тим Чаллис: опыт общины</p>
        <a id="cite-r6-challies-2018-video" data-journal-citation href={cite('challies-2018-video')}>Тим Чаллис. From Every Tribe and Language and People and Nation</a>
      </li>
      <li data-g44-date-kind="publication">
